dialogue cohesion_generic_other_faction
title: Strange customs
trigger: Cohesion faction:other faction:other level=2
once
speaker commander $commander
speaker with $with
speaker hero $hero

node open commander
  At the cook pot, two heroes who grew up under different banners are fighting over a spoon, quietly, the way people fight when they don't know each other well enough to shout.
  -> salt

node salt with
  Salt goes in at the start. Everyone knows that. Where I come from you'd be laughed out of the kitchen.
  -> end

node end hero
  Where I come from, salt at the start means you can't fix it after. You add it last, a pinch at a time, and you taste.
  -> ask

node ask with
  Commander. Settle it. Somebody's stew is going to be wrong tonight.
  * One pot each way, side by side. The camp can vote with spoons. -> vote
    do: AddCohesion $with $hero 7
  * You're both wrong. Teach each other the rest of it while it boils. -> teach
    do: AddCohesion $with $hero 5
  * I'm not choosing between your homes over a stew. Work it out. -> out
    do: AddCohesion $with $hero -3

node vote hero
  A vote. Fine. And when mine wins, you're scrubbing both pots.
  -> banners

node teach with
  The rest of it. All right. What do your people put in for the sour?
  -> banners

node out hero
  Worked out it is. Hand me the spoon. Last, a pinch at a time.
  -> banners

node banners with
  You know, I was told your people were cold. Proud, and not much for sharing a fire.
  -> told

node told hero
  I was told the same of yours. Nobody told me you'd fight this hard over salt.
  * Whoever told you both was a long way from this fire. -> far
    do: AddCohesion $with $hero 8
  * Keep the stories. Just don't let them choose who you stand beside. -> stories
    do: AddCohesion $with $hero 6
  * Some of those stories are true. Keep your guard up. -> guard
    do: AddCohesion $with $hero -4

node far with
  A long way. Aye. They never sat at a pot with you.
  -> close

node stories hero
  We'll keep them for the jokes, then. And stand where we like.
  -> close

node guard with
  Guard up. I've had it up so long I barely notice it any more.
  -> close

node close commander
  Two pots go on the fire. Later, the whole camp tastes both, and the argument starts over, louder, and more friendly.
